# A reviewer's /revise comment on a plan in Implementation Plan: Claude gets
# the attached plan with the comments and revises it; the new plan replaces
# the old attachment, the ticket stays in Implementation Plan (no transition)
# with needs-human, a 🔁 comment says what changed, and the request is resolved.
TICKET_FIXTURE=tickets/plan-written.json
COMMENTS_FIXTURE=comments-revise.json
CLAUDE_FIXTURE=claude/revised.json
ATTACHMENTS_FIXTURE=attachments-previous-plan.json
ATTACHMENT_CONTENT_FIXTURE=previous-plan.md
MOCK_STATUS="Implementation Plan"
